0. TYPE OF EXPERIMENT
   This is a MEASUREMENT-INSTRUMENT experiment, not a model experiment. It changes
   no model component. It changes how configurations are scored, and removes two
   structurally defective feature columns. It is a documented deviation from the
   FIXED-protocol rule in Model 1/instructions.txt, which carries an amendment note.

1. OBJECTIVE
   Determine which internal selection criterion predicts the external Kaggle score.

2. WHY
   E1 chose alpha=0.03 on LOGO-CV 35.98 and scored 172.69929 on Kaggle, against
   102.37237 for a submission that ignores the images. The ruler ranks backwards.

