   rank-3 PCA curve basis, closed-form ridge, clip/cummax/force-100
   projection, tile->image->soil median, 16 CV families, 24/10 split, EMD code.
   Reproducibility assertion: max feature drift vs E1 = 5.68e-14 (< 1e-6 required)

